OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AEA adds AI-generated John Motson to FC
OL,4,A27 video game
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the permission of his widow and
OL,7,Fhis son, Motson's voice has been
OL,8,Fsynthesised using a combination of old
OL,9,Frecording sessions and generative AI.
OL,10,FIt will become available in FC 27 on 26
OL,11,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
