OL,3,AAndy Taylor: Duran Duran's livewire
OL,4,Aguitarist who was a true Wild Boy
OL,5,
OL,6,F"For sure, we paraded around in our
OL,7,Ffast cars with beautiful models on
OL,8,Fyachts in the south of France without
OL,9,Fneeding to pay the bill," he later
OL,10,Fwrote.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
